<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia edges up to 1.8450 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia edges up to 1.8450 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia edged up to 1.8450 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange from 1.8460 at the previous session.</p>
<p>					  March 26	   March 25</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar		1.8450	     1.8460</p>
<p> Volume traded			$7.85 million	  $18.18 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
